手に入れた特殊な薬で、実験場だけで効果を発揮するんだ。","nextNodeIds":[736500207]},{"nodeId":736500207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30225,"speakerName":"ジャミ","textMapHash":3154284026,"text":"その名も「フェーイズポーション」！アムリタ学院の先輩が開発した薬で、製造費が高くて作り方も複雑だから、これだけ作るのにも苦労したよ…","nextNodeIds":[736500208]},{"nodeId":736500208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1172614338,"text":"ん？その薬、おまえの実験となにか関係があるのか…？","nextNodeIds":[736500209]},{"nodeId":736500209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30225,"speakerName":"ジャミ","textMapHash":2968990658,"text":"実は「フェーイズポーション」を飲むと、服用者の主観的な時間感覚がとても…とてもとてもゆっくりになって、まるで周囲が止まっているように見えるんだ…","nextNodeIds":[736500210]},{"nodeId":736500210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30225,"speakerName":"ジャミ","textMapHash":1088168562,"text":"その状態なら、さらに精密な撮影と観察が可能になるというわけさ！","nextNodeIds":[736500211]},{"nodeId":736500211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2978869642,"text":"うーん、そんな薬があるなら、おまえが自分で実験すればいいんじゃないか…？","nextNodeIds":[736500212]},{"nodeId":736500212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30225,"speakerName":"ジャミ","textMapHash":4187913426,"text":"うん…僕も同じことを思ってたんだけど、そう簡単な話でもなくてね…","nextNodeIds":[736500213]},{"nodeId":736500213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30225,"speakerName":"ジャミ","textMapHash":2425626602,"text":"さっきも言った通り、「主観的に」周囲の動きがゆっくりに見えるだけなんだ…つまり元の身体能力が高くないと、実際の反応に体がついていかないんだよ…","nextNodeIds":[736500214]},{"nodeId":736500214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30225,"speakerName":"ジャミ","textMapHash":3772864586,"text":"例えば、「フェーイズポーション」を飲んでいるときにスピノクロコが突進してきたとして、それを回避する反射神経がなければ…","nextNodeIds":[736500215]},{"nodeId":736500215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30225,"speakerName":"ジャミ","textMapHash":1277811986,"text":"その爪が顔のそばで止まっているのは見えても、体は避けることができないんだ…","nextNodeIds":[736500216]},{"nodeId":736500216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30225,"speakerName":"ジャミ","textMapHash":960474514,"text":"「どうして体が動かないんだ」って思うかもしれないけど、ダメなんだ。爪は目の前にあって、その中に溜まってる汚れた水や泥まで見えるのにね…","nextNodeIds":[736500217]},{"nodeId":736500217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3657788858,"text":"うわ…","nextNodeIds":[736500218]},{"nodeId":736500218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30225,"speakerName":"ジャミ","textMapHash":10178418,"text":"だから、主観的に時間の流れが遅く感じるからといって、敵を侮ってはいけない…その点には注意して。","nextNodeIds":[736500219]},{"nodeId":736500219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1897446202,"text":"気をつける！","nextNodeIds":[736500220]},{"nodeId":736500220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30225,"speakerName":"ジャミ","textMapHash":3498364722,"text":"はぁ…僕の研究は二人に任せるよ…","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7365002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30225"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7365001,7365002],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30225,"speakerName":"ジャミ","count":45},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":20},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":7}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[173650],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":3771824502,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"30225":[1160]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingFie